@startuml Part_Gizmos_Wireframe

title Part Selection Handles (8-point resize)

rectangle "Selected Part" as PART

note right of PART
  [Handles layout:]
  [UL=0] [U] [UR=1]
  [L=6] [Part] [R=7]
  [BL=2] [B] [BR=3]
end note

note top of PART
  UL(0): resize left+up    U(4): resize up only    UR(1): resize right+up
  L(6): resize left only   R(7): resize right only
  BL(2): resize left+down  B(5): resize down only  BR(3): resize right+down
end note

note bottom of PART
  Yellow outline (Color 1 0.78 0 0.6)
  Orange handles 6px scales with zoom
  Min part size: 8px
  Snap to 16px grid
end note

@enduml
